{"seq":17,"slug":"frontend-security","title":"前端安全","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security","rating":{"composite":3.55,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"前端安全-简介\">前端安全 简介</h1><p>前端安全是 Web 应用安全体系中至关重要的一环。随着前端应用的复杂度不断提升，单页应用、微前端、第三方脚本集成等架构模式的普及，前端面临的攻击面也在持续扩大。从经典的 XSS、CSRF 攻击到新兴的供应链投毒、原型链污染，前端工程师必须具备系统化的安全意识与防御能力。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于有一定前端开发经验、希望系统掌握 Web 安全攻防知识的中高级工程师。无论你是应用开发者还是安全方向的技术负责人，本知识库都能帮助你构建完整的前端安全知识体系。</p>\n<p>全书共分为四章，从攻击原理到防御实践全面覆盖前端安全领域：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>攻击向量</strong>，详细剖析前端面临的主要安全威胁，包括 XSS 跨站脚本、CSRF 跨站请求伪造、点击劫持和注入攻击，从攻击者视角理解漏洞成因与利用方式。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>防御策略</strong>，针对各类攻击提出系统性的防御方案，涵盖内容安全策略、输入验证与输出编码、认证安全等核心防护手段，帮助读者建立纵深防御体系。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>供应链安全</strong>，聚焦前端生态特有的供应链风险，讲解依赖安全审计、npm 包管理安全、代码完整性校验等关键议题，这是近年来最受关注的安全领域之一。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>安全架构</strong>，从架构层面审视前端安全，涵盖安全响应头配置、HTTPS 与 TLS 最佳实践、安全监控与告警体系搭建，帮助读者将安全融入开发流程。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先通读第一章了解攻击原理，这是所有防御的基础；然后学习第二章的防御策略建立防护意识；接着关注第三章的供应链安全，这是现代前端最易忽视的风险点；最后通过第四章的安全架构将安全实践制度化。建议结合实际项目进行安全审计练习，在真实场景中深化理解。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"attack-vectors","title":"攻击向量","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/attack-vectors","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xss","title":"XSS 跨站脚本攻击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/attack-vectors/xss"},{"seq":2,"slug":"csrf","title":"CSRF 跨站请求伪造","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/attack-vectors/csrf"},{"seq":3,"slug":"clickjacking","title":"点击劫持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/attack-vectors/clickjacking"},{"seq":4,"slug":"injection-attacks","title":"注入攻击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/attack-vectors/injection-attacks"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"defense-strategies","title":"防御策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/defense-strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"csp","title":"内容安全策略 CSP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/defense-strategies/csp"},{"seq":2,"slug":"input-validation","title":"输入验证与净化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/defense-strategies/input-validation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"authentication-security","title":"认证安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/defense-strategies/authentication-security"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-chain-security","title":"供应链安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/supply-chain-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dependency-security","title":"依赖安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/supply-chain-security/dependency-security"},{"seq":2,"slug":"npm-security","title":"npm 安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/supply-chain-security/npm-security"},{"seq":3,"slug":"code-integrity","title":"代码完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/supply-chain-security/code-integrity"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"security-architecture","title":"安全架构","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/security-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"security-headers","title":"安全 HTTP 头","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/security-architecture/security-headers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cors","title":"CORS 跨域安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/security-architecture/cors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-audit","title":"安全审计与监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/security-architecture/security-audit"},{"seq":4,"slug":"https-and-tls","title":"HTTPS 与 TLS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/security-architecture/https-and-tls"},{"seq":5,"slug":"security-monitoring","title":"安全监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/security-architecture/security-monitoring"}]}]}